      "text": "Is Mike Trout in the deal?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET David Chadd",
      "time": "7:14 PM",
      "text": "Only if we throw in a reliever from West MICHIGAN"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:14 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:16 PM",
      "text": "So no? I want to tweet the Trout thing but I have to be responsible!"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:17 PM",
      "text": "“Mike Trout is not involved in the potential Ian Kinsler deal, I’m told.”"
