      "from": "DET David Chadd",
      "time": "7:17 PM",
      "text": "Bingo"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:28 PM",
      "text": "Not for use but what’s the hold up? I know it’s not finalized but Rosenthal said it’s done"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET David Chadd",
      "time": "7:28 PM",
      "text": "Well he’s wrong a few things"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:29 PM",
      "text": "Very rarely"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:23 PM",
      "text": "Are there multiple teams still in on him?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:40 PM",
      "text": "Do I have enough time to go downstairs and get a drink?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:51 PM",
      "text": "I heard it’s done is that true"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET David Chadd",
      "time": "8:52 PM",
      "text": "What did Bream tell you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:52 PM",
      "text": "Nothing"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:56 PM",
      "text": "Who’s in the trade"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:56 PM",
      "text": "Return"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:01 PM",
      "text": "Wikel Hernandez and Troy Montgomery.??"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:01 PM",
      "text": "????"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:34 PM",
      "text": "Was the hold up no-trade clause related?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:35 PM",
      "text": "Like was that just part of the process, maybe needing to track him down to get signed"
    }
  ]
